# Always commit & push

After finishing user-requested code changes that are ready to ship:

1. Commit relevant files with a clear message (vX.Y style when cache-bumped).
2. Push to `origin/main` (or the active tracked branch) so Vercel deploys.
3. Do **not** wait for a separate “push please” — treat deploy as part of Done.

Still follow Git Safety Protocol (no force-push to main, no secrets, no amend of pushed commits unless explicitly requested).
